sudden|PASS: Quick occurrence with little warning is not confused with necessarily great force. The gust and scattered papers give a coherent physical event; all of a sudden is marked as an adverbial phrase.
warrior|PASS: A historical/literary fighter is shown in a mural, without claiming a present military rank. The Vietnamese empty-village return is faithful; the figurative cause-related use is not silently made the same Sense.
anybody|REVIEW: Question/negative unspecified-person use and affirmative free choice are distinct proposals within one source ordinal. Singular agreement and adjective position are checked; canonical boundary and pragmatic coverage remain unresolved.
firearm|REVIEW: Gun/projectile semantics are presented as a formal noun without importing any jurisdiction's legal classification. The museum sentence is descriptive only; specialist terminology and the broad Vietnamese alternative need owner review.
lunch|PASS: A usually midday meal does not require a fixed clock time. Article guidance allows organized meals; the covered terrace and continuing rain are natural and faithfully translated.
